11:41.309 --> 11:45.840
There's so many needs that we have to, to deal with, and even the day-to-day

11:46.435 --> 11:48.829
operation of the city is a lot to handle as well.

11:49.986 --> 11:53.827
What's important to that is there's so many needs from our residents,

11:53.843 --> 11:57.780
there's needs within the city, the staffs, the departments.

11:58.342 --> 12:01.756
But the question is how we can align those needs

12:01.932 --> 12:05.026
