to improve to have a plan for the next

12:48.284 --> 12:51.911
few years. And then last is, which is important,

12:51.927 --> 12:55.332
is and could be hard to measure or to do is

12:55.364 --> 12:59.188
to measure our impact. It's very crucial that— sorry,

12:59.284 --> 13:03.156
Councilmember Clerk-Leopold. No. Okay, sorry, I thought you have a question. So the

13:03.656 --> 13:07.461
last one is how to have that conversation for

